#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:4
msgid "LLM Integrations"
msgstr "Integraciones LLM"

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:6
msgid ""
"LLM (Large Language Model) Integrations connect Morpheus to language "
"model providers. These integrations supply the AI reasoning capabilities "
"that power AI Agents. LLM integrations are **added through Administration"
" > Integrations** and appear as a read-only reference under Tools > AI "
"Services > Integrations."
msgstr ""
"Las Integraciones LLM (Large Language Model) conectan Morpheus a "
"proveedores de modelos de lenguaje. Estas integraciones proporcionan "
"las capacidades de razonamiento de IA que impulsan a los Agentes de "
"IA. Las integraciones LLM se **agregan a través de Administration > "
"Integrations** y aparecen como referencia de solo lectura en Tools > "
"AI Services > Integrations."

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:8
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Tools --> AI Services --> Integrations` to "
"view connected LLM providers."
msgstr ""
"Navegue a :menuselection:`Tools --> AI Services --> Integrations` para "
"ver los proveedores LLM conectados."

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:11
msgid "Adding an LLM Integration"
msgstr "Agregar una integración LLM"

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:13
msgid ""
"LLM integrations are managed from :menuselection:`Administration --> "
"Integrations`:"
msgstr ""
"Las integraciones LLM se gestionan desde "
":menuselection:`Administration --> Integrations`:"

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:15
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`+ ADD`"

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:16
msgid "Select an LLM provider type from the integration type list"
msgstr ""
"Seleccione un tipo de proveedor LLM de la lista de tipos de "
"integración"

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:17
msgid "Configure provider-specific settings (API key, endpoint, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"Configure los ajustes específicos del proveedor (clave API, endpoint, "
"etc.)"

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:18
msgid "Save the integration"
msgstr "Guarde la integración"

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:20
msgid ""
"After saving, Morpheus automatically discovers available models from the "
"provider and syncs them. These models then appear in the **Model** "
"dropdown when configuring AI Agents."
msgstr ""
"After saving, Morpheus automatically discovers disponible models from the "
"provider and syncs them. These models then appear in the **Model** "
"dropdown when configuring AI Agents."

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:23
msgid "Supported Providers"
msgstr "Proveedores compatibles"

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:25
msgid ""
"LLM provider support is plugin-based. The following providers are "
"available:"
msgstr ""
"El soporte de proveedores LLM está basado en plugins. Los siguientes "
"proveedores están disponibles:"

