#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:33
msgid "**GitHub Copilot**"
msgstr "**GitHub Copilot**"

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:34
msgid ""
"GitHub Copilot integration. Requires GitHub Copilot subscription and "
"authentication token."
msgstr ""
"GitHub Copilot integration. Requires GitHub Copilot subscription y "
"authentication token."

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:35
msgid "**Ollama (Local)**"
msgstr "**Ollama (Local)**"

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:36
msgid ""
"Self-hosted open-source models (Llama, Mistral, DeepSeek, etc.). Requires"
" Ollama server URL. No API key needed for local instances."
msgstr ""
"Self-hosted open-source models (Llama, Mistral, DeepSeek, etc.). Requires "
"Ollama server URL. No API key needed for local instancias."

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:37
msgid "**OpenAI-Compatible (Local)**"
msgstr "**OpenAI-Compatible (Local)**"

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:38
msgid ""
"Any local LLM server that exposes an OpenAI-compatible API (e.g., LM "
"Studio, vLLM, LocalAI). Configure with the local server endpoint URL."
msgstr ""
"Cualquier local LLM servidor que exposes un OpenAI-compatible API (e.g., "
"LM Studio, vLLM, LocalAI). Configure con el/la local server endpoint URL."

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:42
msgid ""
"Additional LLM providers can be added through the Morpheus plugin system "
"as they become available."
msgstr ""
"Additional LLM providers puede ser added through the Morpheus plugin "
"system as they become available."

